 "_help_a24": "A-24..A-28 blocks (appended: ids of the blocks above never change). Farming (scripts/Farm.cs, data/farm.json): farmland / farmland_wet = tilled soil (build mode + Interact on dirt or grass); crop_* (shape crop, non-solid) = a planted crop, meta & 3 = growth stage 0..3 (3 = ripe); its pack item is the seed; cropH = height of the ripe plant, cropFruit = size of the ripe fruit (0 = ears on the stalks), mat side = leaf colour, top = ripe colour. Fences (shape fence, collision 1.5 high) and gates (shape gate: meta & 3 = the side it faces, X_open = its open twin). Stations (scripts/Stations.cs, data/stations.json): crafting_table, smithing_table, forge, alchemy_table. Chests: chest_small / chest / chest_large by capacity; home_chest opens the hero's home storage wherever it stands; party_chest opens the party's shared chest.",
 "structures": {
  "_help": "F-19 block structures (scripts/Structures.cs): every town, castle, bridge, shrine, camp and dungeon mouth is a block blueprint stamped into the generated world (the same on every machine; player edits are kept on top). blockStructures false = the old mesh buildings. farRange = metres the merged far-view meshes of the structures are drawn to (beyond the block radius).",
  "blockStructures": true, "farRange": 900
 }
}
